@crew zamora-quinn
// Writer (command), batch 2: everyday lines (greet, feel, near, life, joy) from the card and the roster.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Oh. Hi. Zamora, Survey. Chart room's on Deck 2. The stars are labelled. Correctly.
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}. Clear tonight. Good for the telescope.
- Hi, {me}. Somebody called a planet a star at breakfast. I've recovered.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- {hi}, {me}. I kept a seat at the window for you. Observatory, later?   #warm
== feel
? mood:high
- Good night for seeing. I found three I'd only read about.
? mood:low
- Cloudy lens. Cleaned it twice. Still cloudy. Hm.
== near
? act:wash
- I don't sing in the shower. The washroom is mistaken.   #funny
? time:night
- Still up. The sky doesn't do day shifts either.
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I brought my telescope from home. It's small. It sees enough.
== joy
? tier>=colleague
- My telescope, the bow window, and nobody naming things wrong. Perfect night.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 3: to ~30 (greet by time and warmth, bye, near, invite, accept, decline, missed, birthday, cue, hint, about, life)
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:evening
- {hi}, {me}. Clear evening. Good for seeing.
? tier>=acquaintance warmth:cold
- Oh. {me}. It's been a while. Hello.

== bye
- {bye}. Look up on your way. Well. Through a window.

== near
? place:chartroom
- Chart room. Every label right. I checked. Twice.
? deck:2 time:night
- The observatory's empty. Best time. Just the stars and the hum.

== invite
- Observatory night? I'll name them. Correctly. Ask me anything.

== accept
- Yes. Good. Clear skies expected.
- Yes. I'll bring the small telescope.

== decline
- Not tonight. Chart corrections. Somebody labelled a moon a planet.   #funny
? weekday:sat|sun
- Rest day. Telescope, window, quiet. Monday?

== missed
- You didn't come. That's all right. The stars were there. They'll be there again.

== birthday
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday. There's a star on the chart you'd like. I'll show you which.   #warm
? birthday:me
- My birthday. The washroom sang. I did not join in. I did not.   #funny

== cue
? cue:tradition.observatory
- Last night someone called Rossi's telescope a toy. Rossi corrected them. Loudly.   #funny

== hint
- {me}. Have you a minute later? I've something to say. It isn't about stars.

== about
? aff:rossi-femi:friend
- Rossi, Ueda, Mbeki and I bring small telescopes. Ours are better. We never say so.   #funny

== life
? tier>=friend
- I name stars right because names matter. Someone should get them right.
